use aws in eu-west-2
use gcp in europe-west2
use azure in westeurope

service api
  image a
  scale 0 to 5
  memory 64gb
  env MODE prod
service worker
  image b
database db is postgres 16, medium
database old is postgres 11
database my is mysql 8
database fine is mysql 8.4
database minor is postgres 16.4
bucket assets is public
queue jobs is fifo

load balancer web
  listen on 443 with tls for api.example.com
  listen on 8443
  send / to api
  send /admin to worker

load balancer inner is internal
  listen on 9000
  send / to worker

api connects to db
api connects to worker
api reads and writes assets
worker reads jobs
api sends to jobs

on aws
  service api sets capacity_provider to FARGATE_SPOT
on azure
  service api sets sku to basic
